<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Raise Hitpoints</h1>
<p>Sphere: Protection Sphere
Class: Healer (guild level 75), Paladin (guild level 85)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast raise hitpoints &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast raise hitpoints</a>   (on yourself)
</pre>
<p>Raises the target's hit point ability for ten minutes, so they can take more 
before they fall: a point at first, up to ten points for a master.
</p><p>It doesn't add up: cast on someone who already has it, the magic just 
dissipates. To cast it you must have practiced it; a potion, wand or 
scroll of it works for anyone. You must be standing.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Hitpoints</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Abilities</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Protection Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>